# Lean skill documents

Before writing or editing any file under `skills/`, read [skills/managing-skills/references/lean-contract.md](skills/managing-skills/references/lean-contract.md).

A line earns its place when removing it would change what the agent does. Scan the edited files against every finding category. Fix findings before delivering.

Keep a negative only when the exception is easy to miss or safety-critical. Delete commentary such as "This section explains…".
